Together with
`C7ProjectedCarrierSameTreeInvoiceEmbeddingProducedChargeFieldIdentityReceipt.ofTelescopingRadiusChargeCompatibility`,
this identifies the radius-charge source-field equality with the single
non-Prop produced-charge object equality.
