/--
Proxy-fiber blocker for the physical same-stream receipt.

If no common annular owner-fiber generation exists for the visible five-shadow
source and Carleson budget, the same-owner-fiber receipt is impossible.
-/
structure FiveFrameCarlesonOwnerFiberProxyConfuser
    {pressureL2 : PressureHessianL2Amplitude}
    {radialGrade : Real}
